@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "PRTG 維護";
}

<section class="lf-card mb-3" aria-labelledby="prtg-setup-title">
    <div class="lf-card__header"><h2 class="lf-card__title" id="prtg-setup-title">啟用準備</h2></div>
    <div class="lf-card__body">
        <p class="small text-muted mb-2">依已儲存設定與最近一次檢查結果顯示；設定齊全不代表站台資料完整或預警已驗證。</p>
        <div id="prtg-setup-summary" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在確認 PRTG 啟用狀態…</div>
        <ul id="prtg-setup-steps" class="small mb-0 mt-2"></ul>
    </div>
</section>
<div id="prtg-rule-banner"></div>
<div id="prtg-schedule-banner"></div>
<section class="lf-card mb-3" aria-labelledby="prtg-monitoring-title">
    <div class="lf-card__header"><h2 class="lf-card__title" id="prtg-monitoring-title">監看範圍（可選縮圈）</h2></div>
    <div class="lf-card__body">
        <p class="small text-muted">不選任何主機與 sensor＝評估全部已對應主機與其 sensor。要縮小範圍時，先同步結構與主機對應，再勾選主機；指定 sensor 時須同時勾選所屬主機。改 PRTG 連線位址只會重算對應，不會影響既有數值歷史。</p>
        <form id="prtg-monitoring-form">
            <label class="form-label" for="prtg-monitoring-host-search">搜尋主機（勾選狀態會跨頁保留）</label>
            <p class="small text-muted" id="prtg-monitoring-selection-limits">最多選取 3,000 台主機與 15,000 顆 sensor；超過上限會明確拒絕，不會截斷。</p>
            <input class="form-control mb-2" id="prtg-monitoring-host-search" maxlength="128" autocomplete="off" />
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-monitoring-host-prev" type="button">上一頁</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-monitoring-host-next" type="button">下一頁</button>
                <span class="small text-muted" id="prtg-monitoring-host-page-info"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" id="prtg-monitoring-host-select-page" type="button">勾選本頁主機</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-monitoring-host-clear-page" type="button">取消本頁主機</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" id="prtg-monitoring-host-select-search" type="button">加入目前主機搜尋結果</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger d-none" id="prtg-monitoring-host-select-cancel" type="button">停止批次</button>
                <span class="small text-muted" id="prtg-monitoring-host-batch-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
            </div>
            <div id="prtg-monitoring-hosts" class="border rounded p-2 mb-2" style="max-height:14rem;overflow:auto" aria-label="監看主機"></div>
            <div class="small text-muted mb-1">已保存主機（包含停用、合併或已移除的舊項目）；只載入每頁 100 筆。移除舊項目不會自動移除 sensor，請在下方另行核對。</div>
            <label class="form-label" for="prtg-monitoring-saved-host-search">搜尋已保存主機</label>
            <input class="form-control mb-2" id="prtg-monitoring-saved-host-search" maxlength="128" autocomplete="off" />
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-monitoring-saved-host-prev" type="button">上一頁</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-monitoring-saved-host-next" type="button">下一頁</button>
                <span class="small text-muted" id="prtg-monitoring-saved-host-page-info"></span>
            </div>
            <div id="prtg-monitoring-saved-hosts" class="border rounded p-2 mb-3" style="max-height:14rem;overflow:auto" aria-label="已保存主機管理"></div>
            <label class="form-label" for="prtg-monitoring-sensor-search">搜尋所選主機的 sensor（最多 100 筆／頁）</label>
            <input class="form-control mb-2" id="prtg-monitoring-sensor-search" maxlength="128" autocomplete="off" />
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-monitoring-sensor-prev" type="button">上一頁</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-monitoring-sensor-next" type="button">下一頁</button>
                <span class="small text-muted" id="prtg-monitoring-sensor-page-info"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" id="prtg-monitoring-sensor-select-page" type="button">勾選本頁 sensor</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-monitoring-sensor-clear-page" type="button">取消本頁 sensor</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" id="prtg-monitoring-sensor-select-search" type="button">加入目前 sensor 搜尋結果</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger d-none" id="prtg-monitoring-sensor-select-cancel" type="button">停止批次</button>
                <span class="small text-muted" id="prtg-monitoring-sensor-batch-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
            </div>
            <div id="prtg-monitoring-sensors" class="border rounded p-2 mb-2" style="max-height:18rem;overflow:auto" aria-label="監看感測器"></div>
            <div class="small text-muted mb-2">已選 sensor（包含目前篩選之外及已不在目錄中的 ID）；可搜尋並逐頁移除，每頁最多顯示 100 筆。</div>
            <label class="form-label" for="prtg-monitoring-selected-sensor-search">搜尋已選 sensor ID</label>
            <input class="form-control mb-2" id="prtg-monitoring-selected-sensor-search" maxlength="32" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" />
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-monitoring-selected-sensor-prev" type="button">上一頁</button>
                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-monitoring-selected-sensor-next" type="button">下一頁</button>
                <span class="small text-muted" id="prtg-monitoring-selected-sensor-page-info"></span>
            </div>
            <div id="prtg-monitoring-selected-sensors" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-2" aria-label="已選 sensor"></div>
            <button class="btn btn-outline-primary mt-2" id="prtg-monitoring-estimate" type="button">估算所選範圍</button>
            <div id="prtg-monitoring-estimate-result" class="small mt-2" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <button class="btn btn-primary mt-2" type="submit" disabled>儲存監看範圍</button>
        </form>
        <div id="prtg-monitoring-status" class="small mt-2" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary mt-2" id="prtg-monitoring-preview">預覽已儲存範圍的實際作用範圍</button>
        <div id="prtg-monitoring-preview-result" class="small mt-2" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="lf-card mb-3" aria-labelledby="prtg-operations-title">
    <div class="lf-card__header"><h2 class="lf-card__title" id="prtg-operations-title">通知處理狀態</h2></div>
    <div class="lf-card__body">
        <p class="small text-muted">只顯示可見主機。PRTG 問題只進每日／每週摘要，不寄即時信；SMTP 接受不代表信箱實收。</p>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-operations-refresh">重新查詢</button>
        <div id="prtg-operations-status" class="small mt-2" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
</section>

<ul class="nav nav-tabs mb-3" id="prtg-tabs">
    <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link active" data-tab="connection" type="button">連線</button></li>
    <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-tab="params" type="button">擷取參數</button></li>
    <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-tab="mirror" type="button">鏡像狀態</button></li>
    <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-tab="probe" type="button">環境探測</button></li>
    <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-tab="selected-backfill" type="button">歷史回填</button></li>
    <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-tab="effectiveness" type="button">使用效果</button></li>
</ul>

<div data-panel="effectiveness" class="d-none">
    <section class="lf-card mb-4" id="prtg-effectiveness" aria-labelledby="prtg-effectiveness-title">
        <div class="lf-card__header d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2">
            <h2 class="lf-card__title" id="prtg-effectiveness-title">PRTG 使用效果</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="lf-card__body">
            <p class="small text-muted">依所選日期統計既有資料。各項數字的計算對象不同，彼此不構成轉換流程；「—」代表資料不足以計算，不代表 0。</p>
            <div class="row g-2 align-items-end mb-3">
                <div class="col-12 col-sm-5 col-md-4"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-effectiveness-from">起始日期</label><input class="form-control" type="date" id="prtg-effectiveness-from" /></div>
                <div class="col-12 col-sm-5 col-md-4"><label class="form-label" for="prtg-effectiveness-through">結束日期</label><input class="form-control" type="date" id="prtg-effectiveness-through" /></div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-auto"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="prtg-effectiveness-refresh">查詢</button></div>
            </div>
            <div id="prtg-effectiveness-status" class="small mb-3" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">選擇日期後按「查詢」載入資料。</div>
            <div id="prtg-effectiveness-error" class="mb-3" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <div id="prtg-effectiveness-metrics" class="row g-2 d-none" aria-label="使用效果指標"></div>
            <div id="prtg-effectiveness-rule-marks"></div>
            <details class="small mt-3" id="prtg-effectiveness-details">
                <summary>指標定義與限制</summary>
                <p class="mt-2 mb-1" id="prtg-effectiveness-semantics"></p>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted" id="prtg-effectiveness-limitations"></p>
            </details>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

<div data-panel="selected-backfill" class="d-none">
    <section class="lf-card" aria-labelledby="prtg-full-backfill-title">
        <div class="lf-card__header"><h2 class="lf-card__title" id="prtg-full-backfill-title">全量歷史回填</h2></div>
        <div class="lf-card__body">
            <p class="small text-muted">依已儲存的回填天數、每日高／中風險主機、歷史有效對應、sensor 白名單與監看數值範圍預估。全量表示完整執行這套已設定範圍，不代表全站所有 PRTG sensor。只讀本機鏡像與紀錄，不連線 PRTG；狀態變更的分頁數及來源回應時間無法預估。</p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="prtg-full-backfill-preview">預估全量工作量</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" id="prtg-full-backfill-start" disabled>確認並開始全量回填</button>
            </div>
            <div id="prtg-full-backfill-preview-result" data-runs-url="@Url.Content("~/runs")" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lf-card" aria-labelledby="prtg-selected-backfill-title">
        <div class="lf-card__header"><h2 class="lf-card__title" id="prtg-selected-backfill-title">指定主機歷史數值補值</h2></div>
        <div class="lf-card__body">
            <p class="small text-muted">只補指定主機與日期的 PRTG 歷史數值，不會重跑歷史 finding 評估，也不會建立或派送案件／交辦。最多選 5 台主機、最多 7 天。</p>
            <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
                    <label for="prtg-selected-backfill-search" class="form-label">搜尋已儲存主機</label>
                    <input id="prtg-selected-backfill-search" class="form-control" type="search" autocomplete="off" aria-controls="prtg-selected-backfill-hosts" placeholder="輸入主機名稱或 IP" />
                    <div class="form-text" id="prtg-selected-backfill-host-help">使用方向鍵、空白鍵或滑鼠選取，最多 5 台。</div>
                    <div id="prtg-selected-backfill-hosts" class="border rounded mt-2 p-2" role="group" aria-describedby="prtg-selected-backfill-host-help" style="max-height: 16rem; overflow-y: auto;">
                        <span class="small text-muted">載入主機清單中…</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="small mt-1" id="prtg-selected-backfill-selection" aria-live="polite"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-12 col-lg-6"><div class="row g-3">
                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-6"><label for="prtg-selected-backfill-from" class="form-label">起始日期</label><input id="prtg-selected-backfill-from" class="form-control" type="date" /></div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-6"><label for="prtg-selected-backfill-to" class="form-label">結束日期</label><input id="prtg-selected-backfill-to" class="form-control" type="date" /></div>
                </div><div class="form-text mt-2">含起訖日；日期需在 PRTG 歷史保留範圍內。</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="prtg-selected-backfill-preview">預覽工作量</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="prtg-selected-backfill-start" disabled>確認並開始補值</button></div>
            <div id="prtg-selected-backfill-preview-result" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>
            <div class="border rounded p-3 mt-3" id="prtg-selected-backfill-status" aria-live="polite"><div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2"><span id="prtg-selected-backfill-status-text">讀取回填狀態中…</span><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger d-none" id="prtg-selected-backfill-cancel">停止回填</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" id="prtg-selected-backfill-status-retry">重新整理狀態</button></div><div class="small text-muted mt-1" id="prtg-selected-backfill-progress"></div></div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

<div data-panel="connection">
    <form id="prtg-connection-form">
        <div class="lf-card">
            <div class="lf-card__header">
                <h2 class="lf-card__title">連線</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="lf-card__body">
                <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <label for="prtg-url" class="form-label">PRTG 位址</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="prtg-url" placeholder="https://prtg.example.local" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <label for="prtg-auth-mode" class="form-label">認證方式</label>
                        <select class="form-select" id="prtg-auth-mode">
                            <option value="token">API token（推薦，PRTG 21+）</option>
                            <option value="password">帳號密碼（PRTG 傳統 API / passhash）</option>
                            <option value="passhash">帳號＋passhash</option>
                        </select>
                        <div class="form-text">PRTG 21.x 之後版本建議使用 API token；舊版 PRTG 或特定環境可切換為帳號密碼。</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="prtg-auth-username-field" class="d-none">
                    <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label for="prtg-username" class="form-label">使用者帳號</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="prtg-username" placeholder="prtgadmin" />
                            <div class="form-text">具備讀取權限的 PRTG 登入帳號。</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="prtg-auth-token-fields">
                    <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label for="prtg-api-token" class="form-label">API token</label>
                            <input type="password" class="form-control" id="prtg-api-token" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="留空＝沿用既有 API token" />
                            <div class="form-text" id="prtg-api-token-hint"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="prtg-clear-token" />
                                <label class="form-check-label" for="prtg-clear-token">清除目前的 API token</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="prtg-auth-password-fields" class="d-none">
                    <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label for="prtg-password" class="form-label">密碼</label>
                            <input type="password" class="form-control" id="prtg-password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="留空＝沿用既有密碼" />
                            <div class="form-text" id="prtg-password-hint"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="prtg-clear-password" />
                                <label class="form-check-label" for="prtg-clear-password">清除目前的密碼</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="prtg-auth-passhash-fields" class="d-none">
                    <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label for="prtg-passhash" class="form-label">PRTG passhash</label>
                            <input type="password" class="form-control" id="prtg-passhash" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="留空＝沿用既有 passhash" />
                            <div class="form-text" id="prtg-passhash-hint"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="prtg-clear-passhash" />
                                <label class="form-check-label" for="prtg-clear-passhash">清除目前的 passhash</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-text">
                                passhash 可在 PRTG 的使用者帳號設定頁取得（Show passhash），或自行呼叫 /api/getpasshash.htm 換取。LogForesight 不會保存密碼、也不會替你換取 passhash。
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <hr />

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <h3 class="h6">測試連線</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        用上方表單目前填的值試連線（尚未儲存也可以測）；token 或密碼欄留空時沿用已儲存的值。
                    </p>
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" id="prtg-test-btn">測試連線</button>
                    </div>
                    <div id="prtg-test-result"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mt-3">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="prtg-connection-save">儲存</button>
                    <span class="text-muted small" id="prtg-config-updated"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </form>
</div>

<div data-panel="params" class="d-none">
    <form id="prtg-params-form">
        <div class="lf-card">
            <div class="lf-card__header">
                <h2 class="lf-card__title">擷取參數</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="lf-card__body">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="prtg-fetch-strategy" class="form-label fw-semibold">取數策略</label>
                    <button type="button" class="lf-help" tabindex="0" data-bs-toggle="popover"
                            data-bs-content="保守：每 15 分鐘對 PRTG 查一次快照目標感測器的目前值（一天約 96 次，每 100 顆一個請求，最多三批快照在途，與其他作業共用配額並保留 Profile 位置），夜間不逐顆查詢，數值全由快照供應。激進：每 5 分鐘一次（一天約 288 次），另在夜間對觸發主機逐顆查詢歷史值（每晚數百次、單次 5～70 秒），PRTG 負擔明顯較高。實際的快照目標感測器數與每日寫入列數，請按下方「估算規模」查看。兩種策略下快照連續失敗 3 次都會自動拉長間隔（上限 60 分鐘）。">
                        <svg class="lf-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="@Url.Content("~/img/icons.svg")#question-circle"></use></svg>
                    </button>
                    <select class="form-select" id="prtg-fetch-strategy">
                        <option value="conservative">保守（預設）：每 15 分鐘快照一次，夜間不逐顆查詢</option>
                        <option value="aggressive">激進：每 5 分鐘快照一次，夜間另逐顆查詢觸發主機</option>
                    </select>
                    <div class="form-text">
                        快照是對 PRTG 發一次全量查詢取即時值，由站台自己平均成小時值。
                    </div>
                    <div class="small text-warning mt-2 d-none" id="prtg-strategy-aggressive-hint">
